        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 529.68278681,
        "r": 504.11602985100103,
        "b": 496.7877148320328
      },
      "content": "Motor position is estimated by counting the motor steps, relative to a position reference. Optical switches and flags serve as position references, which are used to find the motor home positions and to verify proper motion. Flag positions are anticipated by software.",
      "section_id": "sec_4_2_3_2",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_auto_362",
      "section_level": 4,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_362",
          "title": "Stepper Motors"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_4_2_3_2",
          "title": "4.2.3.2 MOTOR POSITION SENSORS"
        }
      ],
      "page": 44,
